# Always check out text files with LF, regardless of `core.autocrlf`.
# Biome formats with LF; CRLF working copies (Windows default) make `bun run check` fail.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.sqlite binary
